{
  "_comment": "OrangeServer Docker daemon 配置示例（registry mirror 镜像加速）",
  "_usage": "复制到 /etc/docker/daemon.json (Linux) 或 %USERPROFILE%\\.docker\\daemon.json (Windows) 后重启 docker",
  "_linux": "sudo cp deploy/daemon.json.example /etc/docker/daemon.json && sudo systemctl restart docker",
  "_windows": "复制到 %USERPROFILE%\\.docker\\daemon.json, 重启 Docker Desktop",
  "registry-mirrors": [
    "https://docker.m.daocloud.io"
  ],
  "_mirror_note": [
    "道客 (daocloud.io) 镜像源同步 docker.io 全镜像, 国内拉取快, 推荐主用",
    "如需更多源可加:",
    "  - https://<your-aliyun-mirror>.mirror.aliyuncs.com (阿里云,需注册)",
    "  - https://mirror.ccs.tencentyun.com (腾讯云)",
    "  - https://docker.m.daocloud.io (道客,本示例已用)"
  ],
  "max-concurrent-downloads": 10,
  "log-driver": "json-file",
  "log-opts": {
    "max-size": "10m",
    "max-file": "3"
  }
}
